Wrong (B): CREATE TABLE defines a new table structure in the database schema. It is a data definition command, not a data retrieval command.
Wrong (C): DROP TABLE permanently removes an entire table and all its data from the database. It destroys data rather than retrieving it for analysis.$EXPL$
